s($,"ceo","io",()=>A.a([A.FC("See your trucks on live map. It show where they start, current location, and full path they travel. If driver go wrong way or stop for no reason, Polaris catch it fast so your team can take action and not waste time.","assets/landingpage/livemap.png","Live Route Tracking"),A.FC("When something go wrong in transit, Polaris tell your team right away using WebSockets. If route change, night halt is too long, or truck break down, you get alert direct on dashboard. No need to keep clicking refresh. Team can solve problem much faster.","assets/landingpage/alert.png","Live Alerts"),A.FC("Talk to driver right from Polaris screen, no need to pick up other phone. Just 1-click call, check if call connect, and type your notes direct in shipment history. It keep all communication in one place so nothing get lost.","assets/landingpage/call_driver.png","Call Driver Direct"),A.FC("Look at old finished trips on map timeline. Polaris use road-snap logic to match GPS to real roads. This let your checking team see driver behavior, like wrong stops and bad routes, so you can fix transit delays for future.","assets/landingpage/oldtrip.png","Check Old Routes"),A.FC("Let your operations team put thousands of active trips, PGI, and GRN records using simple Excel upload. Polaris process big data fast and safe, so everyone see the same correct tracking info without doing manual typing mistakes.","assets/landingpage/teamdata.png","Team Data Upload"),A.FC("Watch your team work and logistic health with simple charts. Track how fast agents solve problems, look at call logs, and see bar graphs. You can check single user reports to make your supply chain better and grow your business.","assets/landingpage/dashboard.png","Performance Dashboard"),A.FC("Manage complex 3-shift schedules with our interactive Google Maps route studio. Drag and drop waypoints to reorder them, edit stop geofences by clicking on the map, and upload bulk routes via Excel. Polaris syncs your changes instantly to all active trips.","assets/landingpage/route_management.png","Interactive Route Studio")],A.aZ("N<a5Z>")))
